## Phase 1 — Backend list + multi register

**Goal:** `GET /api/v1/company/me/companies`; register never blocked solely because user already has a company; register always persists `status = pending` and `company_admin` (Company Owner).

**Exit criteria:** 0 / 1 / 2+ companies returned correctly; second POST register succeeds; both rows `pending` with role `company_admin` until super-admin status PATCH.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Service + controller | `webonone-v2/backend/src/services/company.service.ts`, `controllers/company.controller.ts` |
| Route | `webonone-v2/backend/src/routes/company.routes.ts` |
| Repo helper | `webonone-v2/backend/src/repositories/company.repository.ts` |
| Identity roles | Reuse `findCompanyRolesByUserId` via `identityRoleClient.ts` |
| Assumable roles | Prefer only **approved** companies as assumable `company_admin` |

**Verify:** manual HTTP with JWT; Identity + WebOnOne running.

