## Forbidden

- Merging user All Companies with super-admin approval list into one page
- Hand-rolled list row chrome (must use `@webonone/ui-kit` ItemList*)
- Hand-rolled company status pills (must use `StatusTag`)
- Icon-only Add button (must be Plus + text label)
- Rows without a 3-dot menu when Login (or other row actions) are in scope
- Reintroducing one-company-per-user unique constraint
- Auto-approving on client register, or any client path that sets `approved` / `rejected`
- Granting company-owner session for **pending** / **rejected** companies via Login or assumable roles
- New Identity role enum (`company_owner`) — keep `company_admin`
- Status values other than `pending` | `approved` | `rejected`
- New microservice or Identity schema migration for this feature
- Tokens in URLs; calling Identity DB from WebOnOne (service API only)

